---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ArchiveLibrary from '../../components/ArchiveLibrary';
import {archive,events} from '../../lib/catalog';
---
<Layout title="Historical Drive study materials" active="Resources"><div class="page-top"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/resources/">Resources</a><span>/ Historical archive</span></div><h1>Google Drive study archive</h1><p>Find older study guides, practice tests, case studies and production tasks by competition. All 274 files are linked here, grouped into {archive.length} entries.</p></div><div class="archive-notice"><p><strong>Optional historical practice.</strong> Current Maryland and national guidelines take priority. These files’ contents, answers and reuse rights have not been independently verified; links open the originals.</p><p>“Former event name” marks a checked match to an older event name. “Related skill practice” means the material covers some of the same skills. Files without an event match are also listed. Collegiate (PBL) samples are labeled and won’t appear when you filter for a high-school event.</p><p>Dates come from filenames, not a content review. Indexed October 27, 2026. Drive access is controlled by the collection’s owner.</p><a class="plain-link" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nO2RkQTGv4EXQ9myxirF8hmOUSd-d6zF" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open the original collection ↗</a></div><ArchiveLibrary client:load groups={archive} events={events.map(({id,name})=>({id,name}))}/><noscript><p>All material is listed above. Enable JavaScript to filter the archive; individual event materials pages also work without it.</p></noscript></Layout>
